# Nougat extraction stub

**Status:** Not run.

**Rationale.** This replication is driven entirely by the paper's deposited supplementary tables (AF1–AF6) and by the numerical claims in the main text, both of which are already digested into the top-level `REPORT.md` and `report/REPORT.tex` deliverables. A full-paper Nougat / MMD extraction of the Molecular Medicine PDF is not required to reproduce the numerical claims and would add no computational value to the replication.

**If needed later.** To generate a real Nougat MMD extraction of the paper:

```bash
# Fetch the paper PDF
wget -O paper.pdf https://molmed.biomedcentral.com/articles/10.1186/s10020-022-00520-6.pdf

# Nougat CLI (requires GPU or long CPU run)
nougat paper.pdf -o extraction/ --markdown
```

This would produce a machine-readable Markdown+math representation of the full paper, useful for downstream LLM-driven claim-extraction pipelines. It is orthogonal to (and not required by) the current replication.

**Target paper.** Grandt CL, Brackmann LK, Poplawski A, et al. "Radiation-response in primary fibroblasts of long-term survivors of childhood cancer with and without second primary neoplasms: the KiKme study." Molecular Medicine 28:105 (2022). DOI 10.1186/s10020-022-00520-6.
